"text": "They become truth seeds (magical). When you and another each eat a truth seed and make promises to each other, the seeds stay in your guts and ensure that the promises are kept. When you break your promise, the truth seed in your gut sprouts violently into a full-grown gwir-nettle, dealing 1d10+3 damage with advantage (messy, ignores armor) and now you've got a gwir-nettle growing out of you. If the other party breaks their promise, they suffer the same fate."
